## Severity Levels

| Level | Meaning | Action Required |
|-------|---------|-----------------|
| **CRITICAL** | Will cause errors/security issues | Must fix before deploy |
| **HIGH** | Likely to cause problems | Fix before deploy |
| **MEDIUM** | Should be fixed | Fix soon |
| **LOW** | Minor improvement | Fix when convenient |

